WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
Who dares to eat whatever is handed to you?

2
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:05,260
You girl are afraid that I will poison you

3
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:08,140
I will take you in and prepare food for you.

4
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:09,420
This is how you repay me

5
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:11,020
He is young and ignorant

6
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:12,740
My eldest sister wants to harm us

7
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,220
Why did you save us just now?

8
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:18,660
He understands now

9
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:22,140
One of the two actually has the knife-playing lips.

10
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:24,220
Willing to drink tea, Sister Liu

11
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:25,860
Will your base rescue these people?

12
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,940
There is a base down there, and how many people are there?

13
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:32,670
It's time for me to take you down for dinner. Little sister, I'll hold it for you.

14
00:00:32,790 --> 00:00:34,710
It's safe here. If you don't need it, it's up to you.

15
00:00:35,070 --> 00:00:37,940
Wait a minute Lianwoduan
